# No watching — Kebu brand principle

Full text: `docs/product/KEBU-NO-WATCHING.md`.

## Principle

**No watching.** Learning on Kebu = **building real things**, not bingeing videos or LMS courses.

## “Learn to code” on Kebu

Open a project → ship something → get stuck → get unstuck with guidance **on the work** → ship again.

Not: traditional programming course · video modules · watch-to-unlock progress.

## Phase One

Guidance inside Builder / Shop / Opportunity / Kebu ID is OK. **Do not** build course catalogs, lecture LMS, or fake Learn nav unless explicitly assigned.

## Kebu Learn (future)

Must inherit **No watching** — project-based paths only.
